ines%2C_Iowa_-_Winter_on_the_Des_Moines_River_%2824805016620%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Morning_Skyline_-_Des_Moines%2C_Iowa_-_Winter_on_the_Des_Moines_River_%2824805016620%29_%28cropped%29.jpg","page":"Des Moines, Iowa","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Morning_Skyline_-_Des_Moines%2C_Iowa_-_Winter_on_the_Des_Moines_River_%2824805016620%29_%28cropped%29.jpg","credit":"Tony Webster from Minneapolis, Minnesota, United States","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Cheyenne","place":"Cheyenne, Wyoming","at":[41.14,-104.8202],"text":"Rodeo week.","by":"unknown","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/CheyenneWyoming_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-CheyenneWyoming_%28cropped%29.jpg","page":"Cheyenne, Wyoming","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CheyenneWyoming_%28cropped%29.jpg","credit":"Vasiliymeshko","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Denver","place":"Denver, Colorado","at":[39.7392,-104.9849],"text":"Dean, Carlo and the parties, and a trip to Central City.","by":"unknown","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Denver%2C_Colorado_skyline_%28cropped_3x5%29.jpg/500px-Denver%2C_Colorado_skyline_%28cropped_3x5%29.jpg","page":"Denver","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Denver%2C_Colorado_skyline_%28cropped_3x5%29.jpg","credit":"Quintin Soloviev","license":"CC BY 4.0"}},{"name":"San Francisco","place":"San Francisco, California","at":[37.7879,-122.4075],"text":"A job as a night watchman.","by":"bus","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Zeppelin-ride-020100925-195_%285029394846%29.jpg/500px-Zeppelin-ride-020100925-195_%285029394846%29.jpg","page":"San Francisco","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zeppelin-ride-020100925-195_%285029394846%29.jpg","credit":"Craig Howell from San Carlos, CA, USA","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Los Angeles","place":"Los Angeles, California","at":[34.0537,-118.2428],"text":"With Terry.","by":"